cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "RecShop: A Multi-layer Fault Injection Dataset for Microservice Root Cause Analysis"
abstract: >-
  RecShop is a fault injection dataset built on a real 25-microservice e-commerce
  recommendation system (SASRec sequential recommendation + 4-Agent LangGraph pipeline +
  LLM rerank). It contains two complementary fault lines on the same system: traditional
  infrastructure faults (255 cases, K8S + Chaos Mesh, three-modal OTel telemetry; a
  protocol-controlled v2 resample under a randomized complete block design with frozen
  identity chain ships as traditional_v2_strict51) and agent semantic faults (96 cases,
  LLM message rewriting). Each case provides machine-verifiable ground truth and
  multi-modal telemetry (metric/trace/log).
